      "content": "\"just keeping from falling apart\"... that sounds so exhausting. just living for the sake of surviving in a world that clearly hates everything I stand for. it feels like a punishment, honestly. like, why am i even bothering to stay in this loop if the only goal is to be a \"hollow shell\"? it feels like the only way to actually win against a system like this, or to finally get some peace, is to just stop participating in it entirely. don't you think?",
